      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You can now use AI Scan to find vulnerabilities across your whole repository, not just in pull request changes.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-ai-scan-for-repositories-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:11.929Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Once your enterprise has enabled the AI Scan policy , organization owners and security managers can turn on AI Scan for repositories for their organization.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-ai-scan-for-repositories-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:11.929Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This setting is separate from AI Scan for pull requests.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-ai-scan-for-repositories-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:11.929Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "After AI Scan for repositories is enabled, users with write access to code scanning can start a scan from the Code scanning page.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-ai-scan-for-repositories-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:11.929Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "When both AI Scan and CodeQL are scanning the same repository, AI Scan skips issues that CodeQL already reports.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-ai-scan-for-repositories-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:11.929Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "On rescans, AI Scan keeps existing findings open if it detects them again and only reports new findings.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-ai-scan-for-repositories-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:11.929Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "AI Scan alerts flow into the code scanning backlog just like other code scanning alerts and support the same workflows, such as assignees, linked pull requests, and issues.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-ai-scan-for-repositories-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:11.929Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "AI Scan for repositories is available on github.com and GitHub Enterprise Cloud with data residency.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-ai-scan-for-repositories-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:11.929Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Organization-owned repositories: Available for public repositories as well as for both private and internal repositories with GitHub Code Security or GitHub Advanced Security.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-ai-scan-for-repositories-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:11.929Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Repositories owned by personal accounts: Available for public repositories.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-ai-scan-for-repositories-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:11.929Z"
      },
